## Audited release inputs

- Go 1.27.1 runtime and standard-library source, for darwin/arm64 and linux/amd64.
  Sources: https://github.com/golang/go/tree/go1.27.1
- golang.org/x/text v0.14.0, packages unicode/norm and transform.
  Sources: https://github.com/golang/text/tree/v0.14.0
- Unicode data used by those libraries, including normalization tables for
  Unicode 15.0.0 in x/text and Unicode 17.0.0 in Go 1.27.1.
- The contracts-only JSON Schema validator is not linked into the shipped CLI.

The selected production package source files were inspected for additional
notices on both supported platforms. Supplemental Go math notices are retained
conservatively even where the linker can remove unused functions. Race-instrumented
test binaries are verification tools, not shipped release artifacts.
The BoringSSL license bundled in Go applies when building with
GOEXPERIMENT=boringcrypto, not to the ordinary Go configuration used here.
Changes to toolchain, dependency versions, build experiments, or supported
platforms require revisiting this audit.

